      "mentions": [
        "sys_gu_master",
        "sys_righteous_path"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Guts Gu is among the world’s highest quality soul strengthening methods, and even Spectral Soul Demon Venerable praised it.",
      "chapters": [
        853
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "guts-gu-praise",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "gu_guts_gu"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Heaven Overseeing Tower Lord deduces that Fang Yuan seems to have some sort of relationship with Red Lotus Demon Venerable and Spectral Soul Demon Venerable.",
      "chapters": [
        1004
      ],
      "certainty": "inferred",
      "confidence": "C",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "heaven-overseeing-towers-deduction",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_heaven_overseeing_tower_lord",
        "char_fang_yuan",
        "char_red_lotus_demon_venerable"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Chapter 1011 is titled “Spectral Soul? Spectral Soul!”.",
      "chapters": [
        1011
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "name-returns",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "The myriad tribulation grey memory draws out a childhood scene: his grandfather, the clan’s leader, denounces his mother as a demonic path member who must be executed, and his father drives the dagger into her heart.",
      "chapters": [
        1013
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "grey-memory",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "When Spectral Soul Demon Venerable explored Eighty-Eight True Yang Building he found wisdom Gu there, but he could not use it or afford to feed it, because lifespan Gu were hard to find and he did not have enough for himself. His soul path attainment let him make use of aspects of other paths with his own as the foundation, so he did not have much need for wisdom Gu regardless.",
      "chapters": [
        1074
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "wisdom-gu-and-blazing-heaven-demonesss-wealth",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "house_eighty_eight_true_yang_building",
        "gu_wisdom_gu",
        "gu_lifespan_gu"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Fang Yuan later reasons that Blazing Heaven Demoness was plotted against by Spectral Soul and died, and that her accumulated wealth must already have been taken by him.",
      "chapters": [
        1074
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "wisdom-gu-and-blazing-heaven-demonesss-wealth",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_blazing_heaven_demoness"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Sixth Hair claims that once the main body is revived through the sovereign immortal fetus, he would grow beyond every other venerable.",
      "chapters": [
        1076
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "sixth-hairs-claim-about-revival",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_sixth_hair"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Pursuing Ying Wu Xie’s group with a luck path investigative killer move, Fang Yuan counts preventing them from saving Spectral Soul’s main body as victory enough, even if he cannot kill them.",
      "chapters": [
        1153
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "preventing-the-main-bodys-rescue",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_ying_wu_xie"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Purple Mountain True Monarch appears in a fight with Duke Long. Duke Long names him a lingering split soul of Spectral Soul.",
      "chapters": [
        1360
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "southern-border-identity",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_purple_mountain_true_monarch",
        "char_duke_long"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "The next chapter states he is a first generation split soul of Spectral Soul Demon Venerable with a hundred thousand years of cultivation behind him.",
      "chapters": [
        1361
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "southern-border-identity",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "During the Southern Border stretch a chapter is titled with his capture.",
      "chapters": [
        1368
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "capture-title",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Sovereign immortal fetus Gu was meant to surpass rank nine entirely as Sovereign, Spectral Soul Demon Venerable’s ambition, but he only managed to refine it at rank nine, and Fang Yuan snatched it away from him.",
      "chapters": [
        1394
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "rank-ten-ambition",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "gu_sovereign_immortal_fetus_gu"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Chapter 1435 is titled for Spectral Soul’s true inheritance. Spectral Soul’s will passes on the main body’s soul path true inheritance, and Fang Yuan receives that comprehensive cultivation content.",
      "chapters": [
        1435
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "true-inheritance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "inh_spectral_soul_true_inheritance"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Sacred Feather City’s origins are traced to the Late Antiquity Era, named as the era of Spectral Soul Demon Venerable.",
      "chapters": [
        870
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "era-placement",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "house_sacred_feather_city",
        "evt_era_late"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "A later chapter places him and Paradise Earth in that era, a hundred thousand years before the present.",
      "chapters": [
        1867
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "era-placement",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_paradise_earth_immortal_venerable"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "He hunts.",
      "chapters": [
        1968
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "field-chapter-titles",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "The novel gives his might a chapter of its own.",
      "chapters": [
        2030
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "field-chapter-titles",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "A chapter title finally puts the bare form “Venerable Spectral Soul” in front of the reader.",
      "chapters": [
        2042
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "field-chapter-titles",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Chapter 2057 is titled “Spectral Soul’s Death”.",
      "chapters": [
        2057
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "field-chapter-titles",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Chapter 2084 is titled “Spectral Soul’s True Main Body”.",
      "chapters": [
        2084
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "true-main-body",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "A late roster of the Ten Venerables places Spectral Soul in the Late Antiquity Era, a hundred thousand years before the present, alongside Paradise Earth.",
      "chapters": [
        2085
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "ten-venerables-roster",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
